Package: hexvexed
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: hexagonal tile puzzle game
 HexVexed is a hexagon-based tile puzzle: place numbered hex tiles on the
 grid so the numbers match wherever two tiles touch, with number bases from
 binary to hexadecimal, a timer and best-times tables.
